,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in **v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]** and **v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]**\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7688) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nClearing `EditorUndoRedoManager` history using `clear_history()` leaves stale entries referencing previous UndoRedo actions in the History dock (from before history was cleared). Interacting with such entry crashes the editor. \nTested using a script in `@tool` mode.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an UndoRedo action, for example:\n```gdscript\nfunc do_action():\n\t_ur.create_action(\"Change label text\")\n\t_ur.add_do_property(label, \"text\", \"New Text\")\n\t_ur.add_undo_property(label, \"text\", \"Old Text\")\n\t_ur.commit_action()\n```\n2. Call the method that commits that action to add entry to History dock.\n3. Clear UndoRedo history with `clear_history()`.\n4. Open \"History\" dock and click on any entry from before clearing the UndoRedo history\n5. The engine will freeze and crash.\n\nThe MRP includes a small plugin that adds a dock with a label and two buttons. Press \"Do Action\" to commit UndoRedo actions (the label text should change), then press \"Clear History\" to clear UndoRedo history - it should print a \"History cleared\" message on successfull clear.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[undo-redo-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24374871/undo-redo-mrp.zip)\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"ht